  "body": "### What is the issue with the Cookie Store API Standard?\n\nShould the document.cookie API now be marked as deprecated to encourage all users to switch to CookieStore? The synchronous document.cookie API calls are a major source of jank, as noted in [this Chromium issue](https://issues.chromium.org/issues/40524203#comment5).",
